{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/WotHTwoWorldsCropped1200400.gif?t=1745334329\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Timelines, One Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore both modern and medieval versions of the same city. Unravel a mystery shaped by centuries-old rivalry.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with the Past \u2014 as a Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can\u2019t speak. You can\u2019t be seen. But you can affect the world. Solve puzzles by influencing objects and environments across time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Curse That Won\u2019t Let Go</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the origin of a time-warping curse born from desperation, and follow the path of an ancient rivalry between thieves and pirates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylized Comic Panel Cutscenes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a unique visual narrative told through comic book panels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric, Puzzle-Focused Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat. Just thoughtful exploration, rich storytelling and puzzle solving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Will you escape the curse\u2026 or remain just a whisper?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677140/extras/postermain1800.jpg?t=1745334329\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steams